      answer: 'Yes, if your WebM is audio‑only, it still works perfectly.',
    },
    {
      question: 'What bitrate is the output MP3?',
      answer: 'We use a high‑quality VBR setting for the best balance of size and quality.',
    },
    {
      question: 'Is this safe?',
      answer: 'Yes, processing is 100% local. No upload.',
    },
  ],
  relatedTools: [
    { href: '/convert/webm-to-wav', icon: '🎬', name: 'WebM to WAV' },
    { href: '/convert/mp4-to-mp3', icon: '🎬', name: 'MP4 to MP3' },
    { href: '/tools/audio-compressor', icon: '📦', name: 'Audio Compressor' },
  ],
};
---

<ToolLayout {...page} />